        "upstream_review": null,
        "excerpt": "[HISTORICAL - NOT CURRENT GUIDANCE: valid_until 2026-08-28T21:00:00Z has passed. May explain an old rule; do not apply it as current.]\nAudio batch 05: through Friday, August 28, try at most one reload when the player is stuck at 00:00. Keep the task ID, browser state, whether the waveform appears, and whether another clip plays. If playback is still unavailable, report the tool incident; do not assign a content-quality failure or content QN solely from the player failure. A reload is a diagnostic trial, not a confirmed repair or submission receipt. We will review the results before extending this approach."
      },
